{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-organogram0001",
    "name": "univ-v2-organogram",
    "description": "Organogram APIs — create flow.\n\n## Create order\n1. `POST /department/` — org unit (flat; parentDepartmentId is optional on department creation)\n2. `POST /org/` — position seat (`level`, optional `departmentId`)\n3. `POST /org/head` — assign person (`userId`, PRIMARY/ACTING)\n4. `GET /org/cards` — KPI summary\n\n**Removed:** `/subAccount`, `accountId`, `subAccountId`, `hod_departments`.\n`department` / `department_structure` use **hard delete**.\n\nSet `baseurl` + `token`. Permissions: DEPARTMENT_*.\n\nDocs: `ORGANOGRAM_NAMING_CONVENTION.md`, `AFFECTED_APIS_DEPARTMENT_CONSOLIDATION.md`, `ORGANOGRAM_POSTMAN.md`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. department",
      "description": "Flat org units. No parentDepartmentId on department.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "create department",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const row = res.departmentDetails;",
                  "  if (row && row.departmentId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('departmentId', String(row.departmentId));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"departmentName\": \"School of Engineering\",\n  \"departmentCode\": \"SOE\",\n  \"alternateName\": null,\n  \"description\": null,\n  \"departmentType\": \"Academic\",\n  \"parentDepartmentId\": null\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseurl}}/department/",
              "host": ["{{baseurl}}"],
              "path": ["department", ""]
            },
            "description": "**POST /department/**\n\n**Required**\n- `departmentName` (string)\n- `departmentType` (\"Academic\" | \"Admin\")\n\n**Optional**\n- `departmentCode` (string | null)\n- `alternateName` (string | null)\n- `description` (string | null)\n- `parentDepartmentId` (int | null)\n\nHard-delete on DELETE. Supports optional `parentDepartmentId` on creation to automatically build the structure hierarchy."
          },
          "response": []
        },
